    "editorial_reason": "Distinguish Abraham and Keturah's son Medan (Genesis 25:2; 1 Chronicles 1:32) from the Medes descended from Madai (Genesis 10:2; 1 Chronicles 1:5). The inherited Medan source record incorrectly absorbed Medes tribal name witnesses from Kings, Esther, Isaiah, Jeremiah, Daniel and Acts; these belong to group:Mede and not an individual Medan. Preserve only genuine Medan words, remove erroneous aliases, keys, and direct verse attestations without erasing group:Mede sources.",
